<urn:atm:triage:finding/AG7-ATM-QA-104-DEGRADED-WARNING-WRONG-PATH>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AG7-ATM-QA-104-DEGRADED-WARNING-WRONG-PATH" ;
  triage:title "Degraded post-send-warning tests bypass PeerTransportRuntime, not on the peer-listener path" ;
  triage:description "Tests in crates/atm-daemon/src/tests_post_send_graft_warning.rs call DaemonRequestDispatcher::dispatch(...) directly rather than being wired through PeerTransportRuntime. They don't exercise the actual peer-listener path the sprint doc scopes this test group to." ;
